,'Question on encounter forms: \"Is the patient currently taking, or has the patient ever taken, any of the following retroviral medications?  Reason for use?\". This particular concept stores a history of previous use of the associated antiretroviral medications for HIV treatment.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b956382a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1099,1088,'Question on encounter forms: \"Is the patient currently taking, or has the patient ever taken, any of the following retroviral medications?\" or \"Current HIV Medications:\". This particular concept stores a history of active use of the associated antiretroviral medications for treatment.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b956397e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1100,1089,'Question which assesses the year a patient was exposed to a blood transfusion.  The reason this is important is that someone who was transfused last year should not present with clinical findings of AIDS, while someone exposed 8 years ago might very well have been infected via the transfusion.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9563adc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1101,1090,'Generic response to a question.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9563c3a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1102,1091,'Time range which is a month or less than a month.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9563d7a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1103,1092,'Time range which is between two to four times a month.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9563eb0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1104,1093,'Time range which is between two and three times a week.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9563ff0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1105,1094,'Time range which is between four and five times a week.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9564130-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1106,1095,'Time range which is greater than or equal to six times per week.','en',1,'2005-01-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b9564266-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1