e nutritional assistance for the last time?\"','en',1,'2006-10-03 16:25:38',NULL,NULL,'b959e38a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1746,1726,'A non-severe skin eruption. (Fix this)','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:39:04',NULL,NULL,'b959e4ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1747,1727,'A skin eruption of moderate severity','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:39:38',NULL,NULL,'b959e60a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1748,1728,'A severe skin eruption. (fix this)','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:40:35',NULL,NULL,'b959e74a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1749,1729,'A free-text description of an adverse effect to medication.','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:42:51',NULL,NULL,'b959e88a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1750,1730,'Free-text description of results of a radiology exam other than a chest xray.','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:46:13',NULL,NULL,'b959e9ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1751,1731,'A free-text description of an opportunistic infection or co-morbid condition that the patient is known or suspected to have at the present moment','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:49:43',NULL,NULL,'b959ea92-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1752,1732,'Answer to question on encounter form: \"Other changes to prophylactic treatment:\"','en',1,'2006-10-04 11:57:17',NULL,NULL,'b959eb6e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1753,1733,'Question on encounter form: \"Does the patient have any secondary effects?\"','en',1,'2006-10-05 14:58:46',NULL,NULL,'b959ec2c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1754,1734,'Records that the given symptom was absent at the time of the exam','en',1,'2006-10-18 17:30:41',NULL,NULL,'b959ecea-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1755,1735,'Signifies that it is unknown whether the patient had the given symptom at the time of the observation. (This could mean that the patient didn\'t know, or the clinician was unable to ascertain. It should not include the clinician not asking.)','en',1,'2006-10-18 17:37:39',NULL,NULL,'b959ed9e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1756,1736,'Free-text comment about a symptom that may be present, absent, or of unknown presence. (The related symptom should be the answer to another question with the same obs_group_id','en',1,'2006-10-18 17:50:28',NULL,NULL,'b959ee66-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1757,1737,'Signifies that it is unknown whether the patient had previously had the given diagnosis at the time of the observation','en',1,'2006-10-18 17:58:39',NULL,NULL,'b959ef2e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1758,1738,'How many doses of antiretroviral medications the patient has missed in the last month.   Both morning and evening doses count as separate doses.  Doses can be multiple pills, so multiple pills missed at one time still only counts as one dose missed.\r\ncount.','en',1,'2006-10-18 18:12:12',NULL,NULL,'b959f280-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1759,1739,'Free-text reason that a patient was referred to another health establishment','en',1,'2006-10-18 18:16:18',NULL,NULL,'b959f352-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1760,1740,'The reason the patient had poor adherence to treatment.\r\nCoded replies for Lesotho from IMAI.  ','en',1,'2006-10-18 18:30:50',NULL,NULL,'b959f410-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1761,1741,'This term is added for Lesotho and the IMAI forms although it might be universally used.  Defined by KJ','en',1,'2006-10-23 12:28:38',NULL,NULL,'b959f622-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1762,1742,'Status indicating the patient died while enrolled in a program','en',1,'2006-10-27 11:39:50',NULL,NULL,'b959faa0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1763,1743,'A patient whose treatment was interrupted for two or more consecutive months for any reason. (Definition from WHO).  Is this defintion for any treatment?  ARV and TB?  #1565 ABANDONED - TB covers TB','en',1,'2006-10-27 11:41:10',1,'2019-10-23 09:50:08','b959fb5e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1764,1744,'No longer part of a program because they transferred out to another program','en',1,'2006-10-27 11:42:00',NULL,NULL,'b959fc26-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1765,1745,'Treatment was never started because it was refused by the patient