ssues.','en',1,'2006-11-21 20:18:55',NULL,NULL,'b95a3330-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1791,1773,'The patient did not adhere because of alcohol problems.','en',1,'2006-11-21 20:28:07',NULL,NULL,'b95a3402-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1792,1775,'The patient decided to change treatment, but for a reason not on the list.  IMAI required choice.','en',1,'2006-11-22 10:50:03',NULL,NULL,'b95a34ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1793,1776,'There is no money for medication -- this should never be the case for PIH since we don\'t charge poor people for medicine.  Why would we?  However -- this is an IMAI reason for poor adherence.','en',1,'2006-11-22 11:23:46',NULL,NULL,'b95a3588-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1794,1777,'We hope that PIH will always have funds to support our patients','en',1,'2006-11-22 11:24:41',NULL,NULL,'b95a365a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1795,1778,'Reason for a regimen stop on ARV prophylaxis','en',1,'2006-11-22 16:45:53',NULL,NULL,'b95a3722-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1796,1779,'Question on the Lesotho form with IMAI coded answers.  What is the reason that ARVs were substituted or changed -- for 1st line drugs only?','en',1,'2006-11-22 17:08:23',NULL,NULL,'b95a37e0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1797,1780,'Question on the Lesotho form with IMAI coded answers.  What is the reason that ARVs were substituted or changed -- for 2nd line drugs only?','en',1,'2006-11-22 17:11:42',NULL,NULL,'b95a38b2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1798,1781,'Was the patient referred to another health center or clinic?  This is used by Lesotho','en',1,'2006-11-22 17:47:06',NULL,NULL,'b95a3984-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1799,1782,'What is the name of the site/clinic that the patient was referred to?  SHouldn\'t this be datatype coded with hard-coded sites/clinics for Lesotho?','en',1,'2006-11-22 17:51:49',NULL,NULL,'b95a3a42-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1800,1783,'This construct handles the details for a patient who\'s been referred to another side -- where and why?