20',NULL,NULL,'b95a8bbe-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1882,1861,'Does your health keep you from eating, dressing, bathing, or using the latrine? ','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:30:20',NULL,NULL,'b95a8c7c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1883,1862,'Does your health keep you from working at a job, doing work around the house or going to school?','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:31:05',NULL,NULL,'b95a8d3a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1884,1863,'Have you been unable to do certain kinds or amounts of work, housework, or schoolwork because of your health?','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:32:12',NULL,NULL,'b95a8df8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1885,1864,'Has your health limited your social activities (like visiting with friends or close relatives)?  (During past 4 weeks)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:33:43',NULL,NULL,'b95a8eb6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1886,1865,'Have you been a very nervous person? ','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:34:30',NULL,NULL,'b95a8f88-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1887,1866,'Have you felt calm and peaceful? (During past four weeks)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:35:33',NULL,NULL,'b95a9050-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1888,1867,'Type of test for HIV diagnosis, i.e. PCR or serotest','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:35:55',NULL,NULL,'b95a9104-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1889,1868,'Have you felt downhearted and blue?  (How often during past 4 weeks)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:36:27',NULL,NULL,'b95a91b8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1890,1869,'Have you been a happy person? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:38:28',NULL,NULL,'b95a926c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1891,1870,'Have you felt so depressed that nothing could cheer you up? (How often durng past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:39:42',NULL,NULL,'b95a9320-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1892,1871,'Did you feel full of life and energy? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:41:17',NULL,NULL,'b95a93d4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1893,1872,'This is one method of enrollment for new HIV diagnosis','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:42:05',NULL,NULL,'b95a947e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1894,1873,'Did you feel totally without energy? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:43:27',NULL,NULL,'b95a9532-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1895,1874,'Did you feel tired? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:44:17',NULL,NULL,'b95a98f2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1896,1875,'VCT conducted at primary or secondary school. Used to describe method of HIV diagnosis.','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:44:41',NULL,NULL,'b95a99a6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1897,1876,'Did you have enough energy to do the things you wanted to do? (how often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:45:04',NULL,NULL,'b95a9a5a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1898,1877,'Describes method of new HIV diagnosis.','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:45:57',NULL,NULL,'b95a9c76-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1899,1878,'Did you feel weighed down by your health problems? (How often during past four weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:45:59',NULL,NULL,'b95a9d34-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1900,1879,'Were you discouraged by your health problems? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:46:57',NULL,NULL,'b95a9df2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1901,1880,'Did you feel despair over your health problems? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:47:56',NULL,NULL,'b95aa324-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1902,1881,'Were you afraid because of your health? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:48:38',NULL,NULL,'b95aa3d8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1903,1882,'Did you have difficulty reasoning and solving problems, for example, making plans, making decisions, learning new things? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:49:51',NULL,NULL,'b95aa496-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1904,1883,'method of enrollment combined with where patient was enrolled.','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:50:37',NULL,NULL,'b95aa554-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1905,1884,'Did you forget things that happened recently, for example, where you put things and when you had appointments? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:50:52',NULL,NULL,'b95aa90a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1906,1885,'Did you have trouble keeping your attention on any activity for long? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:51:43',NULL,NULL,'b95aa9c8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1907,1886,'Did you have difficulty doing activities involving concentration and thinking? (How often during past 4 weeks?)','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:53:03',NULL,NULL,'b95aaa7c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1908,1888,'You are as healthy as anyone you know','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:54:57',NULL,NULL,'b95aaf7c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1909,1889,'Your health is excellent','en',1,'2007-05-17 10:57:59',NULL,NULL,'b95ab09e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1910,1890,'You have been feeling bad lately','en',1,'2007-04-30 21:53:38',NULL,NULL,'b95ab1ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1911,1891,'How has the quality of your life been during the past 4 weeks? That is, how have things been going for you? ','en',1,'2007-05-17 11:17:25',NULL,NULL,'b95ab788-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1912,1892,'How would you rate your physical health and emotional condition now compared to 4 weeks ago? ','en',1,'2007-05-17 11:25:46',NULL,NULL,'b95abba2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1913,1893,'Response to MOS-HIV questions 4a-f','en',1,'2007-04-30 22:02:36',NULL,NULL,'b95ac020-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1914,1894,'Answer to MOS-HIV questions 4a-f','en',1,'2007-04-30 22:04:26',NULL,NULL,'b95ac688-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1915,1895,'Answer to MOS-HIV questions 4a-4f','en',1,'2007-04-30 22:05:39',NULL,NULL,'b95acaa2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1916,1911,'I avoid touching people if I know they have HIV','en',1,'2007-05-01 08:15:23',NULL,NULL,'b95ad34e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(1917,1912,'I would stop visiting someone after learning that he/she has HIV  ','en',1,'2007-05-01 09:23:11',NULL,NULL,'b95ad498-