 patient in any given calendar month.  Theoretically this number should be the sum total of supervised, self-administered, CHW-administered, and missed doses for that calendar month.','en',1,'2007-08-14 15:30:24',NULL,NULL,'b95d6082-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2405,2613,'What kind of telephone or location of phone -- mobile, land, home, work, family, etc.','en',1,'2007-08-16 14:29:56',NULL,NULL,'b95d6154-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2406,2614,'A mobile telephone or cellular telephone (commonly mobile phone or cell phone) is a long-range, portable electronic device used for mobile communication.','en',1,'2007-08-16 14:30:54',NULL,NULL,'b95d6212-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2407,2615,'The phone is located in the home of the person ','en',1,'2007-08-16 14:31:55',NULL,NULL,'b95d62e4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2408,2616,'The phone belongs to a person close to the patient -- a close relative, or emergency contact.','en',1,'2007-08-16 14:33:32',NULL,NULL,'b95d63a2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2409,2617,'A low level of potassium in the blood. Potassium is an electrolyte that is important to the function of the nerve and muscle cells, including the heart. Hypokalemia is most common in people with diseases that affect kidney function, people who take diuretics, people with eating disorders, or a reaction to TB medicine.','en',1,'2007-08-17 10:41:32',NULL,NULL,'b95d646a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2410,2618,'In medicine (pulmonology), a pneumothorax, or collapsed lung, is a potential medical emergency caused by accumulation of air or gas in the pleural cavity, occurring as a result of disease or injury','en',1,'2007-08-17 11:06:29',NULL,NULL,'b95d653c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2411,2619,'Suspected reason for adverse reaction or new reaction','en',1,'2007-08-17 11:26:32',NULL,NULL,'b95d660e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2412,2620,'Suspected reason for adverse reaction or new symptom','en',1,'2007-08-17 11:27:49',NULL,NULL,'b95d66cc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb