questionnaire.','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:01:41',NULL,NULL,'b95d7522-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2426,2638,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group) adherence questionnaire.','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:05:06',NULL,NULL,'b95d766c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2427,2639,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group) adherence questionnaire.','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:07:00',NULL,NULL,'b95d77ac-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2428,2640,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group Questionnaire)','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:14:00',NULL,NULL,'b95d78ec-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2429,2641,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group Questionnaire)','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:15:29',NULL,NULL,'b95d7a2c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2430,2642,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group Questionnaire)','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:16:49',NULL,NULL,'b95d7b6c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2431,2643,'Question from the ACTG (AIDS Clinical Trial Group Questionnaire)','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:18:36',NULL,NULL,'b95d7cb6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2432,2646,'Number of times the patient has ever shared his/her own ARVs with others in the past','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:32:58',NULL,NULL,'b95d7df6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2433,2648,'Self-reported percentage of antiretrovirals taken in the past month, according to visual analogue scale','en',1,'2007-08-20 14:53:34',NULL,NULL,'b95d7f40-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2434,2649,'Number of children the patient has (both male and female)','en',1,'2007-09-04 12:18:02',NULL,NULL,'b95d8080-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2435,2650,'Has the patient used second-line (MDR-TB) drugs previously?','en',1,'2007-09-14 10:35:37',NULL,NULL,'b95d81ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2436,2651,'The name of the country where the person was born','en',1,'2007-09-14 10:43:24',NULL,NULL,'b95d830a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2437,2652,'The name of the country where the person is currently based','en',1,'2007-09-14 10:45:15',NULL,NULL,'b95d844a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2438,2653,'Lesotho (pronounced li su tu), officially the Kingdom of Lesotho, is a land-locked country, entirely surrounded by the Republic of South Africa. Formerly Basutoland, it is a member of the Commonwealth of Nations. The name Lesotho roughly translates into \"the land of the people who speak Sotho.\"','en',1,'2007-09-14 10:58:24',NULL,NULL,'b95d858a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2439,2654,'The Republic of South Africa is the country at the southern tip of Africa. It borders the Atlantic and Indian oceans and Namibia, Botswana, Zimbabwe, Mozambique, Swaziland, and Lesotho, an independent enclave surrounded by South African territory. South Africa is a member of the Commonwealth of Nations, and is widely regarded as the most socially and economically developed country on the continent.','en',1,'2007-09-14 10:59:22',NULL,NULL,'b95d86fc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2440,2655,'QUESTION FROM ACTG ADHERENCE QUESTIONNAIRE','en',1,'2007-09-16 14:09:30',NULL,NULL,'b95d886e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2441,2658,'Do any of your anti-HIV medications have special instructions, such as “take with food” or “on an empty stomach” or “with plenty of fluids?”','en',1,'2007-09-16 14:19:36',NULL,NULL,'b95d8936-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2442,2661,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:42:45',NULL,NULL,'b95d89fe-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2443,2670,'Free text field recording an individual\'s explanation for why they chose to mark what they did on the visual analogue scale. This is designed to make sure the patient  understands the question.','en',1,'2007-09-18 14:52:57',NULL,NULL,'b95d8abc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2444,2673,'This is an experimental self-report method to measure adherence in Rwanda.','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:32:23',NULL,NULL,'b95d8b8e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2445,2674,'Antiretroviral drug counted during pill count','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:39:33',NULL,NULL,'b95d8c56-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2446,2675,'Number of pills prescribed per day','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:45:47',NULL,NULL,'b95d8d14-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2447,2676,'dispensing date on bottle or date reported from pharmacy','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:48:59',NULL,NULL,'b95d8dc8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2448,2677,'Number of pills the participant reports having taken on day of pill count inquiry','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:53:03',NULL,NULL,'b95d8e90-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2449,2678,'Number of days after dispensing date that participant started taking pills','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:57:36',NULL,NULL,'b95d8f4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2450,2679,'Total number of remaining pills in bottle AND from other locations ','en',1,'2007-09-23 14:59:36',NULL,NULL,'b95d900c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2451,2682,'Patient group','en',1,'2007-09-24 09:30:32',NULL,NULL,'b95d90ca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2452,2683,'Patient group','en',1,'2007-09-24 09:34:19',NULL,NULL,'b95d9188-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2453,2684,'Patient group','en',1,'2007-09-24 09:36:52',NULL,NULL,'b95d9246-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2454,2685,'HIV program for children','en',1,'2007-09-24 09:39:10',NULL,NULL,'b95d92fa-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2455,2687,'The number of days per week the patient is prescribed TB medications during the continuation phase (usually three or seven)','en',1,'2007-09-26 05:29:13',NULL,NULL,'b95d93b8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2456,2688,'A construct consisting of standardized and unstandardized clinical notes                                                   ','en',1,'2007-09-26 07:59:57',NULL,NULL,'b95d9480-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2457,2689,'Free text notes regarding a tuberculosis diagnosis                                                                         ','en',1,'2007-09-26 08:03:10',NULL,NULL,'b95d9548-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2458,2690,'This is the TB treatment regimen marked on the national tuberculosis card                                                  ','en',1,'2007-09-26 09:00:14',NULL,NULL,'b95d961a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2459,2691,'2 months of rifampicin, isoniazid, pyrazinamide, and ethambutol 7 days a week follwed by 4 months of rifampicin and isoniazid 7 days a week','en',1,'2007-09-26 09:00:14',NULL,NULL,'b95d96e2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2460,2692,' 2 months of rifampicin, isoniazid, pyrazinamide, and ethambutol 7 days a week follwed by 4 months of rifampicin and isoniazid 3 days a week','en',1,'2007-09-26 09:01:41',NULL,NULL,'b95d97b4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2461,2693,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:44:02',NULL,NULL,'b95d987c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2462,2694,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:44:28',NULL,NULL,'b95d993a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2463,2695,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:44:57',NULL,NULL,'b95d99f8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2464,2696,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:45:18',NULL,NULL,'b95d9ab6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2465,2697,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:45:43',NULL,NULL,'b95d9b6a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2466,2698,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:46:57',NULL,NULL,'b95d9c28-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2467,2699,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:49:06',NULL,NULL,'b95d9cdc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2468,2700,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:49:36',NULL,NULL,'b95d9d9a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2469,2701,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:50:00',NULL,NULL,'b95d9e4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2470,2702,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:51:41',NULL,NULL,'b95d9f0c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2471,2703,'Month of the year','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:52:09',NULL,NULL,'b95d9fca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2472,2704,'This is the month of the TB adherence report','en',1,'2007-10-01 13:59:08',NULL,NULL,'b95da07e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2473,2705,'This is the year of the TB adherence report','en',1,'2007-10-01 14:00:04',NULL,NULL,'b95da13c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2474,2706,'The patient is feeling well','en',1,'2007-10-01 14:04:17',NULL,NULL,'b95da1fa-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2475,2707,'The clinician did not make a comment','en',1,'2007-10-01 14:05:13',NULL,NULL,'b95da2b8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2476,2708,'Doris Duke Charitable Foundation\'s Operation Research on AIDS Care and Treatment in Africa (ORACTA) program ','en',1,'2007-10-03 14:29:15',NULL,NULL,'b95da600-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2477,2709,'Diarrhea lasting more than 2 weeks','en',1,'2007-10-10 11:18:36',NULL,NULL,'b95da6c8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2478,2710,'The name of the village where the person resides.  It is smaller than a cell. The size ranges from 30 - 50 households.','en',1,'2007-10-10 13:56:09',NULL,NULL,'b95da77c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2479,2711,'An ultrasound of anywhere in the body','en',1,'2007-10-11 17:23:26',NULL,NULL,'b95da84e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2480,2712,'Surgery to make person infertile','en',1,'2007-10-11 21:27:57',NULL,NULL,'b95da90c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2481,2713,'Results of the ultrasound of the abdomen','en',1,'2007-10-12 10:07:38',NULL,NULL,'b95da9d4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2482,2714,'Clinic which provides family planning for patients','en',1,'2007-10-12 10:44:50',NULL,NULL,'b95daa92-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2483,2715,'The surgical unit in a hospital','en',1,'2007-10-12 10:58:50',NULL,NULL,'b95dab46-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2484,2716,'The hospital internal medicine department and wards','en',1,'2007-10-12 11:01:01',NULL,NULL,'b95dabf0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2485,2717,'The pediatrics department and wards in a hospital','en',1,'2007-10-12 11:02:57',NULL,NULL,'b95daca4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2486,2718,'Infection presumed due to malaria','en',1,'2007-10-12 11:37:02',NULL,NULL,'b95dad4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2487,2719,'Anxiety disorder is a blanket term covering several different forms of abnormal, pathological anxiety, fears, phobias and nervous conditions that are described as an irrational or illogical worry that is not based on fact. The term anxiety disorder can cover a range of severities from general social anxieties to panic disorders.','en',1,'2007-10-12 13:35:46',NULL,NULL,'b95dae02-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2488,2720,'Congenital heart disease (CHD) is heart disease in the newborn, and includes structural defects, congenital arrythmias, and cardiomyopathies. CHD is a defect of the heart that exists primarily at birth, and can describe a wide variety of different abnormalities affecting the heart.','en',1,'2007-10-12 14:03:20',NULL,NULL,'b95db190-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2489,2721,'who stage 4','en',1,'2007-10-12 15:51:26',NULL,NULL,'b95db258-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2490,2722,'The family planning methods used in the past','en',1,'2007-10-15 16:39:50',NULL,NULL,'b95db442-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2491,2723,'Should the patient start to use a mosquito net?  Mosquito nets to prevent malaria come treated with insecticide and untreated. In malaria endemic areas adults and children should sleep under a treated mosquito net to raise the safety bar and prevent malaria and other infectious diseases.','en',1,'2007-10-15 16:43:34',NULL,NULL,'b95db500-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2492,2724,'The last name of the patient contact','en',1,'2007-10-15 16:46:56',NULL,NULL,'b95db9ba-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2493,2725,'The first name or names of the patient contact','en',1,'2007-10-15 16:47:42',NULL,NULL,'b95dba6e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2494,2726,'Commentary on the examination of skin','en',1,'2007-10-17 10:40:44',NULL,NULL,'b95dbb22-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2495,2727,'The conjunctiva is a membrane that covers the sclera (white part of the eye) and lines the inside of the eyelids.','en',1,'2007-10-17 10:54:25',NULL,NULL,'b95dbbcc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2496,2728,'The Oropharynx (oral part of the pharynx) reaches from the soft palate to the level of the hyoid bone.','en',1,'2007-10-17 11:01:18',NULL,NULL,'b95dbc8a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2497,2729,'The circulatory system (or cardiovascular system) is an organ system that moves nutrients, gases, and wastes to and from cells, and helps stabilize body temperature and pH to maintain homeostasis.','en',1,'2007-10-17 11:20:00',NULL,NULL,'b95dbfe6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2498,2731,'Comments about symptoms of STI','en',1,'2007-10-18 13:56:52',NULL,NULL,'b95dc0ae-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2499,2732,'Question for \"Visited by village health worker daily?\"','en',1,'2007-10-18 15:07:14',NULL,NULL,'b95dc298-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2500,2733,'The patient received treatment for HIV during hospital stay','en',1,'2007-10-24 13:54:41',NULL,NULL,'b95dc7a2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2501,2734,'The Oropharynx (oral part of the pharynx) reaches from the soft palate to the level of the hyoid bone.  This describes any findings about this part of the anatomy.','en',1,'2007-10-25 09:28:35',NULL,NULL,'b95dc8ba-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2502,2735,'Rales include moist and dry rales, crackling, crepitation, rhonchus, and wheezing sounds in the lungs.','en',1,'2007-10-25 09:32:53',NULL,NULL,'b95dcc84-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2503,2736,'Several types of bacteria consumed through contaminated food or water can cause diarrhea. Common culprits include Campylobacter, Salmonella, Shigella, and Escherichia coli (E. coli).','en',1,'2007-10-25 10:07:29',NULL,NULL,'b95dceb4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2504,2737,'Lymphogranuloma venereum (LGV): variably painful, usually single ulcer that is transient and often missed leading to diagnosis at a later stage of infection; the initiating lesion varies from papule, pustule, vesicle to ulcer occuring 10-14 d after sexual contact with an infected person.','en',1,'2007-10-25 10:59:48',NULL,NULL,'b95dd3e6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2505,2738,'painful, single or multiple (1-3), deep and defined or irregular ulcers seen 3-7 d after sexual contact with an infected person; ulcer has a yellow-gray rough base, with soft induration; unilateral or bilateral tender inguinal adenopathy is seen and may suppurate. Constitutional symptoms are rare. Up to 10% of persons with chancroid may be co-infected with syphilis.','en',1,'2007-10-25 11:01:48',NULL,NULL,'b95dd7ce-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2506,2739,'What is the current prophylaxis treatment?','en',1,'2007-10-25 12:03:27',NULL,NULL,'b95ddbac-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2507,2740,'The prophylaxis treatment is started','en',1,'2007-10-25 12:10:12',NULL,NULL,'b95ddf6c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2508,2741,'The prophylaxis treatment continues','en',1,'2007-10-25 12:12:33',NULL,NULL,'b95de976-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2509,2742,'Dosage ordered for prophylaxis','en',1,'2007-10-25 12:15:58',NULL,NULL,'b95dea3e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2510,2743,'What criteria are present from all WHO Stage? \r\nNote: only adult stages are currently added, but pediatric can be added here.','en',1,'2007-10-25 13:39:28',NULL,NULL,'b95deaf2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2511,2744,'The prophylaxis treatment is stopped','en',1,'2007-10-25 13:45:41',NULL,NULL,'b95debb0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2512,2833,'HIV/AIDS drugs','en',1,'2007-11-01 13:18:58',NULL,NULL,'b95decd2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2513,2834,'Amount of drug dispensed.','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:32:03',NULL,NULL,'b95ded86-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2514,2835,'The number of patients among whom the accompagnateur shares pills\r\n','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:34:16',NULL,NULL,'b95dee3a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2515,2836,'The number of empty pill bottles as reported by the accompagnateur.  This concept is used for pill counts in Rwanda.','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:35:45',NULL,NULL,'b95def02-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2516,2837,'Average DAYS PER WEEK patient misses AT LEAST ONE DOSE OF HIV MEDICATIONS, according to accompagnateur.  This is similar to 2101, but different because it is reported by the accompagnateur, not the   patient.\r\n','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:38:37',NULL,NULL,'b95defc0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2517,2838,'WHEN WAS THE LAST TIME the patient MISSED AT LEAST ONE DOSE OF YOU HIV MEDICATIONS, (according to the acc.).   Similar to 2107, but different because it is reported by the accompagnateur, not the patient','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:41:23',NULL,NULL,'b95df092-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2518,2839,'Same as 2629 (DURING THE PAST 4 DAYS, ON HOW MANY DAYS HAVE YOU MISSED TAKING ALL YOUR DOSES?) but for the accompagnateur (ie, in the last four days, how many days did your patient miss at least one dose?\r\n','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:47:24',NULL,NULL,'b95df164-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2519,2840,'The patient is feeling good','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:52:50',NULL,NULL,'b95df22c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2520,2841,'There are no relevent notes for the patient','en',1,'2007-11-02 11:56:03',NULL,NULL,'b95df2ea-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2521,2842,'Enrolled in the MDR-TB treatment program','en',1,'2007-11-03 09:05:45',NULL,NULL,'b95df3a8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2522,2843,'Male gender','en',1,'2007-11-05 16:18:48',NULL,NULL,'b95df45c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2523,2844,'Female gender','en',1,'2007-11-05 16:19:12',NULL,NULL,'b95df51a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2524,2845,'This is temporary.  Eventually contacts should be recorded as person stubs','en',1,'2007-11-05 16:21:01',NULL,NULL,'b95df5d8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2525,2846,'Sign of genital discharge','en',1,'2007-11-05 16:22:18',NULL,NULL,'b95df68c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2526,2847,'The clinical treatment has failed','en',1,'2007-11-05 16:34:48',NULL,NULL,'b95df74a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2527,2848,'All second-line TB drugs.  Containing all of the tb drugs except for Isoniazid, Rifampicin, Ethambutol, Pyrazinamide, Streptomycin, and any combinations of those.','en',1,'2007-11-05 18:27:21',NULL,NULL,'b95df808-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2528,2851,'Answer to question \"should the patient commence treatment?\"','en',1,'2007-11-06 14:08:12',NULL,NULL,'b95df8d0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2529,2852,'Method of enrollment into treatment','en',1,'2007-11-16 09:09:52',NULL,NULL,'b95df98e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2530,2853,'Someone in the household has received second line TB drugs','en',1,'2007-11-21 11:59:29',NULL,NULL,'b95dfa42-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2531,2854,'Hepatotoxicity (from hepatic toxicity) implies chemical-driven liver damage. The liver plays a central role in transforming and clearing chemicals and is susceptible to the toxicity from these agents. Certain medicinal agents when taken in overdoses and sometime even when introduced within therapeutic ranges may injure the organ.','en',1,'2007-11-21 12:49:32',NULL,NULL,'b95dfb0a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2532,2856,'A non-neoplastic mass, usually in the lungs or brain, caused by a localized tuberculous infection.','en',1,'2007-11-28 11:38:21',NULL,NULL,'b95dfbdc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2533,2857,'Vaginal or urethral discharge not related to ghonnerea','en',1,'2007-11-28 11:40:15',NULL,NULL,'b95dfc90-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2534,2858,'Isosporiasis is a human intestinal disease caused by a parasite called Isospora belli. Symptoms include diarrhea and weight loss. It is sometimes associated with AIDS. ','en',1,'2007-11-28 13:51:07',NULL,NULL,'b95dfd4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2535,2859,'Length of time the patient was hospitalized.','en',1,'2007-11-30 15:14:48',NULL,NULL,'b95dfe16-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2536,2860,'Free-text for location of chest pain','en',1,'2007-12-03 09:20:46',NULL,NULL,'b95dfede-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2537,2862,'Does the patient complain about hunger or lack of food?','en',1,'2007-12-03 13:11:48',NULL,NULL,'b95dff92-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(2538,2863,'Does the patient complain about school expenses?','en',1,'2007-12-03 13:14:08',NULL,NULL,'b95e0050-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),