02',NULL,NULL,'b9699c80-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4665,4027,'A medicine or medicated preparation in the form of a powder. ','en',1,'2009-01-09 09:04:28',NULL,NULL,'b9699d48-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4666,4028,'a route of intaking medication by breathing ','en',1,'2009-01-09 09:06:58',NULL,NULL,'b9699e06-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4667,4029,'A dose of medicine measured by drops','en',1,'2009-01-09 09:08:14',NULL,NULL,'b9699eba-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4668,4030,'A medicated or protective layer or material used as a route for administering medication. ','en',1,'2009-01-09 09:24:20',NULL,NULL,'b9699f78-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4669,4031,'A carbonic anhydrase inhibitor that is used to treat glaucoma, epileptic seizures, benign intracranial hypertension (pseudotumor cerebri), altitude sickness, cystinuria, and dural ectasia.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 10:54:33',NULL,NULL,'b969a036-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4670,4032,'A hormone and neurotransmitter, used as a drug to treat cardiac arrest and other cardiac dysrhythmias resulting in diminished or absent cardiac output, anaphylaxis, sepsis and as a bronchodilator for asthma.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 10:57:45',NULL,NULL,'b969a108-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4671,4033,'Compound of atropine, a tropane alkaloid extracted from deadly plants of the family Solanceae.  A competitive antagonist for the muscarinic acetylcholine receptor, it serves as a drug with a wide variety of effects.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 10:59:23',NULL,NULL,'b969a1d0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4672,4034,'A form of penicillin, slowly absorbed into the circulation after intramuscular injection.  Useful when prolonged low concentrations of benzathine penicillin are required and appropriate.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:00:32',NULL,NULL,'b969a2a2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4673,4035,'A mineral supplement and the form of calcium most widely used in the treatment of hypocalcemia.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:00:58',NULL,NULL,'b969a63a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4674,4036,'A topical steroid, used to treat many inflammatory and autoimmune conditions, e.g., rheumatoid arthritis.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:03:54',NULL,NULL,'b969a6f8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4675,4037,'Blood sugar.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:04:59',NULL,NULL,'b969a7b6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4676,4038,'A hormone that increases blood pressure and blood sugar, and reduces immune responses.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:06:14',NULL,NULL,'b969a86a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4677,4039,'A common local anesthetic and antiarrhythmic drug. Lidocaine is used topically to relieve itching, burning and pain from skin inflammations, injected as a dental anesthetic, and in minor surgery\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:09:21',NULL,NULL,'b969a928-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4678,4040,'Monophasic oral contraceptive.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:09:55',NULL,NULL,'b969a9fa-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4679,4041,'Sugar acid with antioxident properties.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:12:33',NULL,NULL,'b969aab8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4680,4042,'A stimulant laxative drug. It is typically prescribed for relief of constipation and for the management of neurogenic bowel dysfunction.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:13:17',NULL,NULL,'b969ab76-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4681,4043,'A lincosamide antibiotic. It is usually used to treat infections with anaerobic bacteria but can also be used to treat some protozoal diseases, such as malaria. It is a common topical treatment for acne, and can be useful against some methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) infections.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:14:11',NULL,NULL,'b969ac48-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4682,4044,'Compound used for hormone replacement therapy, typically in menopausal women.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:14:59',NULL,NULL,'b969ad1a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4683,4045,'An antidepressant of the selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI) class.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:15:38',NULL,NULL,'b969add8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4684,4046,'An anti-diabetic drug in a class of medications known as sulfonylureas.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:16:03',NULL,NULL,'b969ae96-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4685,4047,'A typical antipsychotic. It is in the butyrophenone class of antipsychotic medications and has pharmacological effects similar to the phenothiazines.  Haloperidol is a primitive antipsychotic used in the treatment of schizophrenia and, more acutely, in the treatment of acute psychotic states and delirium.  \r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:17:48',NULL,NULL,'b969af54-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4686,4048,'A broad-spectrum antiparasitic medication, traditionally used against worms (except tapeworms), also found to be effective against most mites and some lice too.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:18:14',NULL,NULL,'b969b030-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4687,4049,'The combination of carbidopa and levodopa is used to treat Parkinson\'s disease and Dopa-Responsive Dystonia (DRD).\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:18:44',NULL,NULL,'b969b0f8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4688,4050,'A synthetic form of thyroxine (thyroid hormone).\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:19:11',NULL,NULL,'b969b1c0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4689,4051,'A drug combination effective in treating malaria.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:19:41',NULL,NULL,'b969b292-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4690,4052,'An oral anti-diabetic drug from the biguanide class.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:20:12',NULL,NULL,'b969b350-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4691,4053,'A highly potent opiate analgesic drug.  Acts directly on the central nervous system (CNS) to relieve pain, and at synapses of the nucleus accumbens in particular. Morphine is highly addictive; tolerance, physical and psychological dependence develop rapidly.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:20:34',NULL,NULL,'b969b3fa-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4692,4054,'Antibacterial agents, typically used for eye infections life conjunctivitis.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:20:56',NULL,NULL,'b969b4c2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4693,4055,'A water-soluble vitamin, part of the vitamin B group.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:21:17',NULL,NULL,'b969b576-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4694,4056,'An antibiotic. It is usually used in treating urinary tract infection.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:21:41',NULL,NULL,'b969b62a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4695,4057,'A metal halide salt composed of potassium and chlorine.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:22:03',NULL,NULL,'b969b6d4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4696,4058,'An anthelmintic effective against flatworms.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:22:41',NULL,NULL,'b969ba4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4697,4059,'A first-generation H1 receptor antagonist, antihistamine and antiemetic medication.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:25:18',NULL,NULL,'b969bb02-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4698,4060,'The sodium salt of valproic acid and is an anticonvulsant used in the treatment of epilepsy and bipolar disorder, as well as other psychiatric conditions requiring the administration of a mood stabilizer\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:58:30',NULL,NULL,'b969bbb6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4699,4061,'A diuretic and is used as an antiandrogen.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:58:49',NULL,NULL,'b969bdbe-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4700,4062,'A chemical compound that has found clinical use as an anticonvulsant and mood-stabilizing drug, primarily in the treatment of epilepsy, bipolar disorder, and less commonly major depression.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:59:14',NULL,NULL,'b969be7c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4701,4063,'Part of the retinyl group, essential for visual perception in the eye.\r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 11:59:40',1,'2024-07-10 14:07:12','b969c354-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4702,4064,'A chemical compound with the formula ZnO.  \r\n','en',1,'2009-01-09 12:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b969c412-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4703,4067,'Is the child adopted?','en',1,'2009-01-12 05:59:27',NULL,NULL,'b969c4c6-8d80-11d8-abbb