ation of previous treatment in months for a transfer-in mdr-tb patient.  Used by the mdr-tb module.','en',1,'2008-07-28 14:57:50',NULL,NULL,'b96aa6c0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4904,3514,'A generic field that allows for recording a previous registration number at a center from which a patient was transferred.  Used by the mdr-tb module.','en',1,'2008-07-28 14:57:02',NULL,NULL,'b96aa792-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4905,3513,'Generic text field for recording a previous treatment center for transfer patients.  Used by the mdr-tb module.','en',1,'2008-07-28 14:55:29',NULL,NULL,'b96aa85a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4906,1565,'A patient who dies for any reason during the course of MDR-TB treatment. (Definition from WHO )','en',1,'2006-08-31 16:59:01',NULL,NULL,'b96aa92c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4907,1564,'Category IV patient who has completed treatment according to the program\'s protocol but does not meet the definition for cure because of lack of bacteriological results - i.e. fewer than five cultures were performed in the final 12 months of treatment. (Definition from WHO Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant tuberculosis)','en',1,'2006-08-31 16:58:12',NULL,NULL,'b96aa9ea-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4908,1413,'D-Alanine analog used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:11:21',NULL,NULL,'b96aaac6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4909,1419,'Anit-folate used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:31:09',NULL,NULL,'b96aab84-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4910,1524,'Patient previously treated for tuberculosis who has not been declared cured or treatment completed, and then diagnosed with MDR-TB (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 13:34:28',NULL,NULL,'b96aac4c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4911,1414,'Isonicotinic acid derivative used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:13:40',NULL,NULL,'b96aad14-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4912,1523,'Patient who has never received antituberculous treatment or has received treatment for less than one month. This includes patients who had DST at the start of a WHO Category I regimen and are then switched to a Category IV regimen because of resistance (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 13:33:11',NULL,NULL,'b96aaddc-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4913,3518,'Corresponds to the working WHO definition for XDR TB.','en',1,'2008-07-28 15:00:46',NULL,NULL,'b96aaeb8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4914,1509,'Patient who has returned after the re-treatment has failed (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-22 21:31:39',NULL,NULL,'b96aaf76-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4915,3013,'First line tuberculosis drugs','en',1,'2008-04-17 11:10:28',1,'2019-10-04 12:20:25','b96ab048-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4916,1412,'Phenazine derivative used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:09:51',NULL,NULL,'b96ab106-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4917,1415,'Isonicotinic acid derivative used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name Pto from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:15:32',NULL,NULL,'b96ab1c4-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4918,1417,'Aminoglycoside used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:23:03',NULL,NULL,'b96ab282-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4919,1525,'Patient who has returned to treatment with confirmed MDR-TB after interruption of treatment for two months or more (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 13:36:51',NULL,NULL,'b96ab340-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4920,3010,'Used to describe second-line TB drugs that are not quinolones, injectibles, or first-line','en',1,'2008-04-17 11:04:03',NULL,NULL,'b96ab412-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4921,1391,'Free text area for treatment plan','en',1,'2006-06-15 12:16:02',NULL,NULL,'b96ab4d0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4922,1563,'Category IV TB patient who has completed treatment according to the program\'s protocol and has at least five consecutive negative cultures from samples collected at least 30 days apart in the final 12 months of treatment. If only one positive culture is reported during that time, and there is no concomitant clinical evidence of deterioration, a patient may still be considered cured, provided that this positive culture is followed by a minimum of three consecutive negative cultures taken at least 30 days apart. (Definition from WHO Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant tuberculosis)','en',1,'2006-08-31 16:56:31',NULL,NULL,'b96af63e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4923,1406,'Injectable aminoglycoside used in drug-resistant TB treatment. Inhibits protein synthesis through disruption of ribosomal function. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-10 16:36:07',NULL,NULL,'b96af742-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4924,3504,'A state in the culture status workflow of an mdr-tb program.  Used by the mdr-tb module.','en',1,'2008-07-28 14:42:23',NULL,NULL,'b96af814-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4925,1418,'Fluoroquinolone used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:26:16',NULL,NULL,'b96af8d2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4926,1530,'Patient that does not fit into any of the following categories - new, relapse, treatment after default, treatment after failure of first treatment, treatment after failure of re-treatment, or transfer in. This group includes Category IV patients who were treated outside DOTS programs and for whom the outcome of the latest treatment is unknown. (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 16:15:16',NULL,NULL,'b96afba2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4927,1529,'Category IV patient who has been transferred from another register for treatment of drug-resistant TB to continue Category IV treatment. His/her outcome should be reported to the transferring unit so that it can report his/her outcome in the cohort in which s/he originally started Category IV treatment. This group is excluded from the quarterly reports of the receiving unti on registration and treatment result. (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 16:12:20',NULL,NULL,'b96afc92-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4928,1526,'Patient who has returned after the first treatment has failed (Definition from World Health Organization Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant TB)','en',1,'2006-08-23 13:37:51',NULL,NULL,'b96afd82-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4929,1411,'Cyclic polypeptide used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-10 16:40:48',NULL,NULL,'b96afe54-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4930,6141,'This covers patients who are assigned to an ART program.','en',1,'2009-02-10 17:25:11',NULL,NULL,'b96aff1c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4931,6142,'This program is for patients who are HIV positive, but have not started ARVs.','en',1,'2009-02-10 17:27:23',NULL,NULL,'b96affda-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4932,6143,'Treatment program for pregnancy patients','en',1,'2009-02-12 10:19:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b0156-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4933,1416,'Fluoroquinolone used in drug-resistant TB treatment. (Short name from WHO)','en',1,'2006-07-11 10:21:37',NULL,NULL,'b96b0214-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4934,2868,'Was the patient on time for their scheduled visit','en',1,'2007-12-03 15:39:28',NULL,NULL,'b96b02c8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4935,6144,'The mother delivered the baby, and the baby is now on formula.','en',1,'2009-02-12 20:27:02',NULL