t failure.','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:39:48',NULL,NULL,'b96b304a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4961,5092,'Oxygen saturation, as measured from a peripheral oximeter.','en',1,'2004-08-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b368a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4962,3968,'description of leaflet.','en',1,'2008-12-03 15:07:34',NULL,NULL,'b96b3752-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4963,3183,'Lisinopril is in a group of drugs called ACE inhibitors. Lisinopril is used to treat high blood pressure, congestive heart failure, and to improve survival after a heart attack','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:37:09',NULL,NULL,'b96b3a54-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4964,3184,'Aldactone is a potassium sparing diuretic that prevents your body from absorbing too much salt and keeps your potassium levels from getting too low.','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:38:25',NULL,NULL,'b96b3b1c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4965,3186,'Atenolol is used alone or in combination with other medications to treat high blood pressure. It also is used to prevent angina (chest pain) and treat heart attacks. Atenolol is in a class of medications called beta blockers.','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:40:59',NULL,NULL,'b96b3c48-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4966,3187,'Amlodipine (as besylate, mesylate or maleate) is a long-acting calcium channel blocker (dihydropyridine) used as an anti-hypertensive and in the treatment of angina','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:42:32',NULL,NULL,'b96b3d10-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4967,3188,'Potassium is an essential dietary mineral and electrolyte.','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:48:01',NULL,NULL,'b96b3dd8-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4968,3189,'','en',1,'2008-06-17 13:58:30',NULL,NULL,'b96b3ea0-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4969,3190,'Warfarin is used to prevent blood clots from forming or growing larger in your blood and blood vessels.','en',1,'2008-06-17 14:00:25',NULL,NULL,'b96b3f54-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4970,2995,'Marking ART patients in register as also receiving TB treatment.','en',1,'2008-03-18 14:36:50',NULL,NULL,