45',NULL,NULL,'b96b4f1c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4991,1845,'Program to give food/nutrition packages out to patients on HIV or TB treatment, or who are undernourished and deemed to require nutritional aid.','en',1,'2007-03-12 21:44:57',NULL,NULL,'b96b508e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4992,3000,'Did the patient transfer out?','en',1,'2008-04-07 11:25:50',NULL,NULL,'b96b523c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4993,3001,'The date that the patient was transferred out.','en',1,'2008-04-07 11:30:39',NULL,NULL,'b96b5372-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4994,3003,'The location that we will transfer out to.','en',1,'2008-04-07 11:44:19',NULL,NULL,'b96b54b2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4995,3004,'Explanation for the transfer out of the patient.','en',1,'2008-04-07 11:50:49',NULL,NULL,'b96b55f2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4996,1737,'Signifies that it is unknown whether the patient had previously had the given diagnosis at the time of the observation','en',1,'2006-10-18 17:58:39',NULL,NULL,'b96b5732-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4997,1656,'Question on the intake form:  \"number of cattle that the patient\'s family owns?\"','en',1,'2006-09-21 11:58:24',NULL,NULL,'b96b5886-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4998,3075,'Do (would) daily home visits by a community health worker disrupt your routine?','en',1,'2008-05-20 11:48:45',NULL,NULL,'b96b594e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(4999,2956,'Answer to home ownership','en',1,'2008-02-12 11:24:32',NULL,NULL,'b96b5a0c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5000,747,'Fluconazole is an antifungal medication of the azole (triazole) class, and is used to treat systemic yeast and fungal infections.  Commonly called Diflucan.','en',1,'2004-03-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b5aca-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5001,2951,'Size of largest parcel in hectares.  Question of land ownership \r\n','en',1,'2008-02-12 11:09:17',NULL,NULL,'b96b5b92-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5002,2949,'Do you own land?','en',1,'2008-02-12 11:05:58',NULL,NULL,'b96b5c50-8d80-11d