 with the virus.','en',1,'2004-04-25 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b6420-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5013,797,'A nucleoside analogue antiviral drug that inhibits the replication of retroviruses such as HIV by interfering with the enzyme reverse transcriptase.','en',1,'2004-04-08 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b64f2-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5014,796,'A nucleoside analogue antiviral drug that inhibits replication of retroviruses such as HIV by interfering with the enzyme reverse transcriptase.','en',1,'2004-04-08 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b65ba-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5015,794,'Combination of two medications in a category of HIV antriretrovirals called protease inhibitors. Lopinavir and ritonavir prevent HIV from multiplying.','en',1,'2004-04-08 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b6682-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5016,792,'Combination antiretroviral drug.','en',1,'2004-04-08 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b674a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5017,768,'Combination drug also known as Rifater.  Used in the early treatment of tuberculosis.','en',1,'2004-03-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b6808-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5018,2955,'Question of home ownership','en',1,'2008-02-12 11:20:08',NULL,NULL,'b96b68c6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5019,766,'A crystalline phenolic alcohol C8H11NO3 of the vitamin B6 group found especially in cereals and convertible in the body into pyridoxal and pyridoxamine.','en',1,'2004-03-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b697a-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5020,625,'A synthetic antiretroviral nucleoside (C10H12N2O4) that is an analog of thymidine and is administered orally in the treatment of HIV infection.','en',1,'2004-01-01 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'b96b6a4c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5021,2941,'How often do you boil or treat your drinking water.\r\nQuestion in 6 mo psychosocial form ORACTA.','en',1,'2008-02-12 10:45:19',NULL,NULL,'b96b6b14-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(5022,2940,'Question of fuel source','en',1,'2008-02-12 10:28:03',NULL,NULL,'b96b6bc8-8d80-11d8-