 and offer greater than 70% protection compared with no net','en',1,'2002-10-03 00:33:24',NULL,NULL,'b97ee2b6-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6656,9234,'Raltegravir (RAL, Isentress, formerly MK-0518) is an antiretroviral drug produced by Merck & Co., used to treat HIV infection.Raltegravir targets integrase, an HIV enzyme that integrates the viral genetic material into human chromosomes, a critical step in the pathogenesis of HIV','en',1,'2002-10-03 00:37:05',NULL,NULL,'b97ee3ec-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6657,9235,'treatment for atypical mycobacteriosis','en',1,'2002-10-03 00:39:58',NULL,NULL,'b97ee518-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6658,9237,'Asthma medical history workflow questions','en',1,'2002-10-09 18:51:31',NULL,NULL,'b97ee626-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6659,9238,'Hypertension Social history questions','en',1,'2002-10-09 22:05:04',NULL,NULL,'b97ee734-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6660,9240,'Reason for C/Section','en',1,'2002-10-31 19:58:28',NULL,NULL,'b97ee838-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6661,9242,'ART medication side effect','en',1,'2002-11-06 17:57:43',NULL,NULL,'b97ee946-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6662,9243,'Concept set for all asthma drugs','en',1,'2002-11-14 16:51:54',NULL,NULL,'b97eea40-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6663,9244,'Asthma inhaler','en',1,'2002-11-14 16:53:41',NULL,NULL,'b97eeb4e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6664,9245,'Asthma medication drugs','en',1,'2002-11-14 17:02:31',NULL,NULL,'b97eec52-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6665,9246,'Epilepsy Medication concept set','en',1,'2002-11-16 18:54:22',NULL,NULL,'b97eef5e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6666,9247,'Confirm that the patient has epilesy','en',1,'2002-11-21 23:47:54',NULL,NULL,'b97ef076-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6667,9248,'Type of confirmed epilepsy','en',1,'2002-11-21 23:52:32',NULL,NULL,'b97ef18e-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6668,9249,'epilepsy chronic conditions','en',1,'2002-11-28 23:00:39',NULL,NULL,'b97ef29c-8d80-11d8-abbb-0024217bb78e'),(6669,9250,'epilepsy